{"i":716,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":4,"phase":"play","name":"Eli","text":"Round 4/5, flood=3, I'm down with Hana (base). Stay with pact partner Hana to build trust, wait to force her climb decision or my volunteer later. Climb risks her anger/jury bitterness."}
{"i":717,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":4,"phase":"play","name":"Fenn","text":"I'm out and safe. Dara and I have a pact, but Dara is also pacted with Cole. Cole, Dara, and I are all out. Eli and Hana are down with Hana as base. The rope is unused. If someone reaches_down, they become anchor and rescue the base, but must climb last. With flood at 3 and round"}
